ontentRight":28},{"id":29,"type":30,"tags":31,"lang":15,"slug":32,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"link_type":18,"key":35,"isBroken":20},"ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD","form-v2",[],"from-2.62","2024-03-28T12:02:58+0000","2026-07-09T07:23:30+0000","1c75ef2f-b922-41df-ac7c-b8d52385bc58",{"heading":37,"includeInternational":38,"desktopBackground":39,"tabletBackground":40,"mobileBackground":41},"Large parcel delivery",true,{},{},{},"hero_banner$261dc302-38d0-4304-a2f6-1abf27c09cc0","hero_banner",null,{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":47,"primary":49,"id":74,"slice_type":75,"slice_label":44},"cardWithImageNoCta",[48],{},{"CardImage":50,"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":62,"CardText":63,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":51,"alt":54,"copyright":44,"url":55,"id":56,"edit":57},{"width":52,"height":53},1000,667,"A mother is placing the lid on a parcel box with the shipping label attached so it is ready to send. Her two children are sat on the sofa behind her reading a book.","large-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc65bqstJ9-inP_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7587.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zc65bqstJ9-inP",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},0,1,"transparent","none","Send a large parcel",[64,68,71],{"type":65,"text":66,"spans":67},"paragraph","Looking to send a large or heavy parcel? We’ve made heavy parcel sending simple with our large package Courier service. No matter where or how far your parcel needs to go, our Couriers will get it there quickly and securely.",[],{"type":65,"text":69,"spans":70},"You can send heavy parcels with our large item Couriers provided they weigh 15kg or less, have a maximum length of 120cm, and a combined circumference and length of no more than 245cm.",[],{"type":65,"text":72,"spans":73},"This means you can easily send everything from scooters to pushchairs and even sound systems using your local Evri Courier collection service, ParcelShops, and Lockers.",[],"card$0e8124fd-50a8-4907-9896-0d69c9844c83","card",{"variation":77,"version":25,"items":78,"primary":94,"id":99,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":44},"default-slice",[79,82,85,88,91],{"Col1Content":80,"Col2Content":81},"0-1kg","£3.29",{"Col1Content":83,"Col2Content":84},"1-2kg","£4.79",{"Col1Content":86,"Col2Content":87},"2-5kg","£6.59",{"Col1Content":89,"Col2Content":90},"5-10kg","£6.68",{"Col1Content":92,"Col2Content":93},"10-15kg","£10.28",{"SectionTitle":95,"SectionSubtitle":96,"Col1Header":97,"Col2Header":98,"TableFooter":44,"isTableShort":20},"How much does it cost to send a large parcel?","With Evri, you can send heavy parcels at small prices. All our large parcel postage fees are based on parcel weight, so it's easy to work out how much it might cost to ship your items, regardless of shape and size.\n\nSee how cheap it is to send a parcel to a UK home address using our Standard delivery service:","Parcel weight","Prices from","information_table$9fd5dc27-9af1-4170-866f-7ee86f6669b5","information_table",{"variation":77,"version":25,"items":102,"primary":103,"id":118,"slice_type":119,"slice_label":44},[],{"title":104,"bodyText":105,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":38,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":44,"buttonLink":110,"image":112},"Are you VAT registered?",[106],{"type":65,"text":107,"spans":108,"direction":109},"Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],"ltr",{"link_type":111},"Any",{"dimensions":113,"alt":44,"copyright":44,"url":114,"id":115,"edit":116},{"width":52,"height":53},"large-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&w=1000&h=667","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":117,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},2,"feature_banner$82015ae7-eacb-496b-8582-cbc3b7daa552","feature_banner",{"variation":77,"version":25,"items":121,"primary":137,"id":141,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":44},[122,125,128,131,134],{"Col1Content":123,"Col2Content":124},"1kg","£10.04",{"Col1Content":126,"Col2Content":127},"2kg","£11.66",{"Col1Content":129,"Col2Content":130},"5kg","£13.46",{"Col1Content":132,"Col2Content":133},"10kg","£17.56",{"Col1Content":135,"Col2Content":136},"15kg","£23.27",{"SectionTitle":138,"SectionSubtitle":139,"Col1Header":97,"Col2Header":98,"TableFooter":140,"isTableShort":20},"Send a large parcel abroad","Did you know you can send international parcels with Evri? Whether you've got friends in America, and want to use our cheap postage to the USA, family in China, or customers in Australia - we deliver to 200+ countries and territories across the world.\n\nSee how little it costs to send an international parcel with our weight and prices table below:","Quoted prices will vary based on the international destination, speed of service, and parcel size and weight. Different terms and conditions will apply to each service.","information_table$7e801b6b-f2cf-47c5-a8e3-e6ea00136ca9",{"variation":77,"version":25,"items":143,"primary":145,"id":178,"slice_type":75,"slice_label":44},[144],{},{"CardImage":146,"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":152,"CardText":153,"ButtonText":173,"ButtonUrl":174,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":147,"alt":148,"copyright":44,"url":149,"id":150,"edit":151},{"width":52,"height":53},"A father is measuring the circumference of a parcel box at his desk using measuring tape. His children are resting on the sofa behind him.","large-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc-5bqstJ9-inW_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7708.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zc-5bqstJ9-inW",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},"How to weigh and measure a large parcel",[154,157,161,164,167,170],{"type":65,"text":155,"spans":156,"direction":109},"Are you finding it tricky to measure and weigh a heavy parcel? Follow our steps below to make the whole process that much easier:",[],{"type":158,"text":159,"spans":160,"direction":109},"o-list-item","Start by weighing the item you want to send before wrapping it. If you find the item is too cumbersome to weigh on its own, weigh yourself holding the item and then minus your own weight to get your item’s weight",[],{"type":158,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":109},"Next, wrap or package your parcel appropriately and measure its dimensions using a tape measure. Then add the two shortest sides together, multiply these by 2, and add the longest side to get your parcel's overall size",[],{"type":158,"text":165,"spans":166,"direction":109},"Finally, re-weigh your parcel in the same manner as before to get its final weight. If your parcel weighs 15kg or less and is 245cm overall or shorter, it’s ready to be sent",[],{"type":65,"text":168,"spans":169,"direction":109},"Remember, if you don’t weigh or measure your parcel correctly, you might be overcharged for your parcel’s price. Any overweight or over-sized parcels may not be deliverable by our large package Couriers, so it’s essential you get your measurements correct before sending.",[],{"type":65,"text":171,"spans":172,"direction":109},"Be sure to look at our size and weight article if you want more guidance in this area.",[],"Size and weight guide",{"link_type":175,"key":176,"url":177},"Web","ed5c5227-d237-4b7b-ae12-be1c3d587e74","large-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fparcel-size-and-weight-guide","card$071a04d9-75c1-4345-b08e-679ae709ed64",{"variation":180,"version":25,"items":181,"primary":197,"id":201,"slice_type":202,"slice_label":44},"listNoIcon",[182,188,191,194],{"title":183,"content":184,"isNumbered":38},"Start by wrapping your parcel and measuring its dimensions, then weigh it to ensure it doesn’t exceed our maximum parcel weight limit",[185],{"type":65,"text":186,"spans":187},"",[],{"title":189,"content":190,"isNumbered":38},"Next, book your parcel online or through our app, making sure you add in the measurements you just took to get an accurate price",[],{"title":192,"content":193,"isNumbered":38},"Once you’ve entered your parcel’s details, select either our Courier collection to have the item collected from your home or drop it off in-person at your nearest ParcelShop or Locker",[],{"title":195,"content":196,"isNumbered":38},"Finally, print your postage label off at home or by using our Print in ParcelShop devices, for free, stick them on your parcel, and add any finishing touches before sending it on its way",[],{"theme":198,"title":199,"description":200,"showPaddingTop":20},"standard","How to post a large parcel","Sending long or heavy parcels with a large item Courier is simple with Evri. We offer two different yet easy options for you to choose from, so you can pick the method that suits you best:","list_block$c87b75fa-2a89-413d-b0c7-d151dd690428","list_block",{"variation":204,"version":25,"items":205,"primary":207,"id":227,"slice_type":75,"slice_label":44},"cardNoImageWithCta",[206],{},{"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":208,"CardText":209,"ButtonText":223,"ButtonUrl":224,"IsEco":20},"Sending large parcels internationally",[210],{"type":65,"text":211,"spans":212,"direction":109},"You can send all sorts of heavy parcels across the UK and beyond. Simply book your parcel online and choose our Courier collection service or drop it off at your nearest ParcelShop for us to deliver your parcel abroad.",[213,220],{"start":214,"end":215,"type":216,"data":217},112,138,"hyperlink",{"link_type":175,"url":218,"target":219},"large-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service","_blank",{"start":214,"end":221,"type":222},139,"strong","Learn more",{"link_type":175,"key":225,"url":226},"111dbb9b-3ead-42a2-8395-602bcea3f4d6","large-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel","card$7fc840df-1edd-4446-a4dd-83c7c0b80030",{"variation":77,"version":25,"items":229,"primary":258,"id":260,"slice_type":261,"slice_label":44},[230,242],{"questionTitle":231,"questionBody":232},"How to pack a heavy parcel for delivery",[233],{"type":65,"text":234,"spans":235},"Packaging your parcel correctly is a big step in making sure it gets to its destination safely. That’s why it’s so important to get each step right during the wrapping process. To make sure you do this properly, why not read our article on how to send heavy packages?",[236,239],{"start":237,"end":238,"type":222},240,266,{"start":237,"end":238,"type":216,"data":240},{"link_type":175,"url":241},"large-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-a-heavy-package",{"questionTitle":243,"questionBody":244},"Heavy parcel cover",[245,248],{"type":65,"text":246,"spans":247},"All large Evri parcels automatically qualify for free parcel cover up to a value of £20. This protects your parcel against, loss, theft, and damage, and can even be increased up to a value of £999 to match the value of the item being sent.",[],{"type":65,"text":249,"spans":250},"However, not all items are covered for compensation. Be sure to check out what we can’t cover in our guide to non-compensation items before you send.",[251,254],{"start":252,"end":253,"type":222},101,133,{"start":252,"end":255,"type":216,"data":256},132,{"link_type":175,"url":257},"large-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fwhat-can-i-send",{"title":259},"Heavy parcel FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$56988f3f-4058-47a4-ab38-502328a4346e","frequently_asked_questions",[23,45,76,101,120,142,179,203,228],{"heroCardContent":264},[265],{"id":29,"uid":44,"url":44,"type":30,"href":266,"tags":267,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"slugs":268,"linked_documents":269,"lang":15,"alternate_languages":270,"data":271},"large-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD%22%29+%5D%5D",[],[32],[],[],{"monotypeTitle":272,"heading":281,"headingSupplement":282,"subheading":283,"promoText":284,"headingInternational